    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b61bf8dfd610f32369d7f4c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呃，啊ー，不行不行。又成这个套路了！\n果然只会摆架子的家伙，一点也不帅气啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05eba81108ec346d8418c38646572db5d0c2c9a2c08aebf9cc559afedd054968",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
