    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f1bbc73b0dabc2d5014ba4c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天，是一年四次的『选拔赛』的开赛日。能否在这里\n取得成绩并受到邀请，将会大大改变马娘们的未来――",
      "source_fingerprint": "3749c59c216ddf2e849ea714bda0fda9cae4ad0d1c8d2b815051b807192dc339",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1009/storytimeline_041009001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
