      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be247406d9590d480cd8292",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我环顾四周，这儿从新人到老手聚集了很多训练员。\n……今天大家的目标，果然是那两个人吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82f233ba7471542953fcc32b677189ab02e6eab213efca543695375f0b341702",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1009/storytimeline_041009001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15ea508b8ba33eeeb67cd347",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "引人注目的两人，已经火花四溅了……\n看来会是一场有趣的比赛……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "462e2628899d8f7974f984f03bd59a5cb6de0f45dfbd8d96291310a8ff94a769",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1009/storytimeline_041009001.json",
