      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "别的孩子，也跟着加快了速度。那样的话\n到最后就留不住脚力了……这正是赤骥所预想的展开吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63b55c2f67b334f6be94a25f820524b19738ec36d11e12d4672909bfc4e14248",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
