      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥，以惊人的跑法始终主导着整场比赛。\n――但是，最终直线才能决定胜负！",
      "source_fingerprint": "948df2246ae802df81022adefcd82a44d2df58a02d56c18e876ca9e4d4d33e69",
